{'symbol': 'AMZN', 'date': '2021-09-30 09:16:00', 'title': "AMAZON COUNTERFEIT CRIMES UNIT REACHES SETTLEMENT WITH INFLUENCERS WHO RAN SOCIAL MEDIA COUNTERFEITING SCHEME, PERMANENTLY BANNING THEM FROM AMAZON'S STORE AND SECURING FINANCIAL PAYMENTS TO BE DONATED TO SUPPORT ANTI-COUNTERFEITING AWARENESS", 'text': "SEATTLE--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMAZON (NASDAQ:AMZN) TODAY ANNOUNCED A SETTLEMENT WITH KELLY FITZPATRICK AND SABRINA KELLY-KREJCI WHO USED TIKTOK, INSTAGRAM, AND FACEBOOK TO PROMOTE AND FACILITATE THE SALE OF COUNTERFEIT LUXURY FASHION GOODS IN AMAZON'S STORE, AS WELL AS ON OTHER ONLINE MARKETPLACES. IN THE LAWSUIT, FILED IN NOVEMBER 2020 IN THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE WESTERN DISTRICT OF WASHINGTON, AMAZON SHOWED THAT THE INDIVIDUALS CONSPIRED TO PROMOTE COUNTERFEIT LUXURY BRAND PRODUCT"}